储、领用、废弃处置全流程。\n4. 制定车间安全操作规程、HSE管理制度，落实IATF16949安全相关体系要求，配合政府安监、环保检查。\n5. 发生工伤、安全事故第一时间到场处置，完成事故8D复盘、上报、整改预防，建立安全事故台账。\n6. 监督车间动火、高空、有限空间等高风险作业审批，现场旁站监护，制止违章操作。","Require":"1.本科及以上学历，安全工程、机械、化工、机电类专业；持有注册安全工程师证优先。\n2.2年以上制造工厂安全管理实操经验，整车/压铸/涂装车间安全管理经历优先。\n3.熟悉消防规范、特种设备管理、危化品管控、安全生产法律法规，会编写安全制度与演练方案。\n4.能独立完成隐患排查、事故分析、政府安监对接，熟练使用Excel整理安全台账报表。\n5.责任心强，敢管敢制止违章，能适配车间两班倒、现场加班，具备良好沟通协调能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":"智界品牌事业部","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-06T16:34:22","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"6ddb87b2-463e-479b-b922-b56f2d54ed39","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561282663,"PostDateInt":1786005262000,"PostDate":"2026-08-06T16:34:22","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"【智界汽车】制造中心-智造工厂-工艺工程师-总装(J29677)","OrgId":3373122,"Org":"